¬import il from "../../../../../_shared/variables/imageLinks"


#### Add flagged word to shared dictionary

1. Note the flagged word you want to add to the shared dictionary. 

> In the image below that is **Toggleable**. *- red rectangle*

{{::il.Vscode_CodeSpellChecker_File_6_img}}

if not created create...

1. Create a text file. 

> In the image below we created a file called **UiSharedDictionary.txt**. *- red rectangle*

2. In the directory **D:/GitHub/**. *- orange rectangle*

3. Add the words you want to appear in the shared dictionary, each on a new line. 

> In the image below you can see the word **toggleable**. *- yellow rectangle*

4. A sub-menu appears. *- green rectangle*

5. Select **Add Words to User Settings**. *- purple rectangle*

{{::il.Vscode_CodeSpellChecker_SharedDictionary_img}}


6. The word is added to the **Code Spell Checker** words in the user settings. 

> In the image below the wrd added is **Frontmatter**. The flagging disappears from the the word in the text. *- red rectangle*

{{::il.Vscode_Settings_UserJson_Cspell_img}}

